{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f456ac2a-ab11-8ee8-b008-f549e2e5f4fa",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T12:27:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi? Yeah, I'm calling about the road on Dixon Street? The edge of the pavement is crumbling away at the curve? And it's getting worse every week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:25:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the edge of the road is breaking up at a curve. Where on Dixon Street is that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my shop, 122 Dixon Street? In the North End? I own the place, so I'm there every day and I watch cars swing wide around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "122 Dixon Street, got it. And is it the edge by the curb side, or is it out in the travel lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the edge, like the side where the asphalt just falls off? But people go around it into the middle, so it's kind of both? I've called about this kind of thing before and nothing, honestly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. I'll write it up now. Did something happen there, or is it just the condition of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:26:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my car hit it Tuesday? And I got a bent rim and a tire that's, like, done? So does the city reimburse for car damage? Because that's a few hundred dollars for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you how that'd go, because claims are handled separately. I can take your information and have someone get you the claim paperwork. Do you want that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:26:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please? And can you add Dixon Street to the repair list? Like actually on the list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in the request for 122 Dixon Street, crumbling road edge at the curve, with the vehicle damage noted. A crew supervisor will look at it. Someone usually calls back within a couple of days. Best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0159?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:26:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0159. And if you're at the shop, what are your hours? I'll note when they can reach you. Is it nine to five?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, what, nine to five? No, no, I open at ten? I close at six? Ten to six?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:27:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten to six, thank you for correcting me. I'll put that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? Thanks? I just really hope somebody actually comes out this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it all in the request, Ms. Wilcox. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too? Bye?"
    }
  ],
